# The real context reader and study compiler run with imported labeled fixtures.
name: Inspect and bind immutable study context without activation
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR
env: KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
require-live-snap: 20 TOOLS | module
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | form
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 2 immutable revisions | context-catalog
expect: alpha
expect: beta
expect: Omit threat-model context
expect: Grounding check: failed
ask: Can the operator distinguish available revisions and explicit omission, with no implied workspace activation?
keys: Up a
require-live-snap: 15 Inspect this exact revision | inspection-required
ask: Does the uninspected-revision message explain the next action without losing the selection?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | context-preview
expect: alpha
ask: Does the preview identify the selected context and show useful source-grounded content before acceptance?
resize: 80x24
live-snap: context-80
ask: Are selection, reading controls and the next action clear at 80x24?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: context-60
ask: Is the stacked context browser readable and navigable at 60x20?
resize: 40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 scanning. | context-40-last
expect: Esc back
ask: Can the complete preview be read at 40x12 without hiding the acceptance and back controls?
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 15 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | complete-document
resize: 96x89
live-snap: context-tall
expect: Complete selected context document
ask: Is the distinction between summary and complete scanner document explicit?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: context-wide
ask: Does the wide context browser retain a comfortable reading width and clear hierarchy?
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | context-selected
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | selected-plan
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART selected
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | reopen-context
keys: Up a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | omission-selected
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | omitted-plan
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/study_context.py @TMP_TARGET @ART omitted
expect: explicitly omitted
ask: Does the revised plan disclose explicit omission and require fresh approval while retaining investigation accounting?
keys: Esc C-c
env: NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | restored-study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | restored-context
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restored-preview
expect: alpha
expect: Grounding check: failed
ask: After restart without color, does the saved study retain its selected revision with honest grounding status and clear controls?
keys: Esc Esc C-c
